      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a feeling. it's who i am. i look in the mirror and i just see someone who isn't worth the air they're breathing. some people are just born bad, i think. i feel like i'm just taking up space that better people could use. it's like i'm just a stain on everything.",
